<UserControl x:Class="WinFace.Pages.AboutPage"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
    <StackPanel Margin="36,30,36,30" MaxWidth="820" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,22">
        <Image Source="/winface.png" Width="64" Height="64" />
        <StackPanel Margin="16,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <TextBlock Text="WinFace" Style="{StaticResource H1}" />
          <TextBlock x:Name="Version" Style="{StaticResource Sub}" />
        </StackPanel>
      </StackPanel>

      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" BorderBrush="{StaticResource Good}">
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="Privacy: everything stays on this PC" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Sub}" Margin="0,6,0,0" LineHeight="20" xml:space="preserve">•  WinFace never uploads anything: no account, no cloud, no telemetry, no ads.
•  Camera images are never saved or shown (except intruder photos, if you turn them on) -
    only face templates (numbers), in
    C:\ProgramData\WinFace, readable only by administrators.
•  Your Windows password is encrypted by this PC's TPM chip; only the lock screen can use it,
    and the encrypted copy is useless on any other computer.
•  Internet: the installer downloads the InsightFace model; the update check asks GitHub
    for new versions (nothing about you is sent; off switch above). Face unlock itself stays offline.
•  Home › Erase all face data removes all of it at any time.</TextBlock>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>

      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel>
            <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="Check for updates" Click="OnCheck" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            <TextBlock Text="Updates" Style="{StaticResource H2}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
          </DockPanel>
          <CheckBox x:Name="AutoUpdate" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" Margin="0,12,0,0" Click="OnAuto">
            <TextBlock Text="Check for updates automatically (at sign-in and once a day)" Style="{StaticResource Body}" />
          </CheckBox>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Sub}" FontSize="12" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                     Text="Asks GitHub whether a newer WinFace release exists. Nothing about you or this PC is sent. A new version is only installed when you click 'Update now'; your faces, password and settings are kept." />
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>

      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="Safety" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Sub}" Margin="0,6,0,12"
                     Text="Face unlock is always just one option: your PIN and password keep working on the lock screen (Sign-in options). If something ever goes wrong, the recovery guide explains how to switch face unlock off, even from the Windows recovery console." />
          <WrapPanel>
            <Button Content="Privacy policy and warning" Click="OnPolicy" Margin="0,0,8,0" />
            <Button Content="Recovery guide" Click="OnRecovery" Margin="0,0,8,0" />
            <Button Content="Uninstall WinFace" Click="OnUninstall" />
          </WrapPanel>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>

      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="Credits and licences" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Sub}" Margin="0,6,0,0" xml:space="preserve">WinFace - Apache License 2.0
Face detection and landmarks: Google MediaPipe (Apache 2.0)
Anti-spoofing: MiniFASNet, Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing by minivision (Apache 2.0)
Face recognition: InsightFace buffalo_l / w600k_r50 - non-commercial research use only,
    downloaded from InsightFace during setup; you accepted its terms there.
Neural network runtime: ONNX Runtime (MIT)
Unlock sound: "Key Videogame SFX" by mrstokes302 on Pixabay (Pixabay Content License)</TextBlock>
          <Button Content="github.com/nyxri0f8/winface" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Click="OnGitHub" />
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
    </StackPanel>
  </ScrollViewer>
</UserControl>
